window.products.push({"id":532232,"name":"24\" White Tabletop Christmas Tree, with Tree Topper and Ball Ornaments Decorations Kit (Silver & Blue), LED String Lights, Mini Pine Artificial White ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b-0bISkeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring Christmas Cheer in Your Home: This white mini tree is actually pretty impressive when you look at it. From a distance, it looks like a real snow covered tree. Although it only take small place, this sweet little tree really will brighten up your home. The blue and silver Christmas ornaments add more romantic and warm Christmas atmosphere. All in One Box: Package includes 20\" tall artificial white Christmas tree, 1 string of 30 warm white LED lights, 1 string of 30 colored LED lights, 24 pcs 1.18\" Christmas ball ornaments (royal blue, sky blue, white, silver), 1 silver star treetopper. All parts are well packed in a beautiful printed box. The decorative accessories are perfectly matched. You will be surprised after you DIY your own white mini Chrismtas tree. Easy to Set Up and High Quality: No assembly required. Just take the mini Christmas tree out of box and bend the branches to make it into the shape you want, and also adjust the red berries and pine cones to a better look. Just hang the ornaments, star tree topper and lights on your own mini tree. It won't take much time, but bring you happy DIY time. This prelit small Christmas tree is constructed with high quality non-toxic and flame retardant PVC green needles, ductility and firm iron wire. With 2 Different LED String Lights: Comes with 2 different 30 LED string lights. One is warm white, the other is colored. Battery operate, which make it convenient to place the mini white Christmas tree anywhere you like. The lights not only brighten your space, but also bring you full of Christmas festive atmosphere. The lights let the tabletop tree much more eye-catching. Perfect for Small Places Christmas Decoration: Table white Christmas tree creates Christmas cheer in your home with pretty ornaments and LED lights. Ideal for decorating home, offices, classrooms with a little holiday cheer. Perfectly fit on a countertop, table, desk, showcase, mantel etc. Great addition to any existing Christmas decor theme!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b-0bISkeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"gonfaci","source_asin":"B09D2GHGC9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-532232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D2GHGC9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D2GHGC9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":532233,"name":"Cubiker Computer Desk 55\" Modern Sturdy Office Desk Large Writing Study Table for Home Office with Extra Strong Legs, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KCr7DsHqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Modern Design: Multiple colors choose, storage bag will help organize your working space. Sturdy and Stable: Iron strut design and adjustable leg pads provide greater stability. Easy to Assemble: Step by step instruction and included assembly tools. Dimension: 55\" W x 23.8\" D x 28\" H Applicable Room and Function: Suitable for study, working, gaming.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KCr7DsHqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cubiker","source_asin":"B0828JRCSP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-532233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0828JRCSP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0828JRCSP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":532234,"name":"【2022 All New】 OriGlam Portable Electric Balloon Blower Pump, Dual Nozzle Balloon Air Inflator, 110V 680W with 2 Inflation Nozzles for Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51O1iWrY6AL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Features: Power:800W Voltage: US: AC 110V ~ 120V Operating Temperature Range: 0 ~ 40℃. Color:Red  With the time controller and speed controller,can adjust the inflating time and the speed according to the balloon. Touch-on switch design, just put the small tips on the nozzle, then press the nozzle slightly, and it will inflate the balloon. Adjustable two tips for small balloon, when inflate the small size balloon, just put the tips on the inflation port. Operations: 1.Plug in the power supply. 2.3 Put a 10-inch latex ball around the air nozzle. 3.Put the switch in \"I\" gear. 4.Inflate the balloon with the pressure nozzle, release and stop the exhaust. 5. Twist the small air nozzle clockwise into the air nozzle. 6. Put a small latex ring ball on the air nozzle. 7. Press the air nozzle to inflate the balloon, release and stop the exhaust. 8.When gas is not used, turn the switch to gear 0.   Use steps if time and speed control are required:  1.Put the switch in the \"II\" file and the time display screen will light up. 2.Press the first time button, and the number on the right side of the screen will jump (milliseconds). 3.Press the second time button to adjust the time you want (0.1-9.9). 4.After you adjust the time you want, press the first time button to confirm. 5.If you think the wind speed is fast, you can turn the speed control button to the right and the wind speed will be slower. 6.After setting the time you want, Press the second power start button( green button).That is to start according to the set time inflatable.  Package Weight : 1685.0 G / 59.44 Ounces Package Dimensions (L*W*H) : 160*200*150 MM / 6.30*7.87*5.91 Inches Package Include: 1 x Balloon Pump 2 x Small Tips 1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51O1iWrY6AL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OriGlam","source_asin":"B01CFZX3GK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-532234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CFZX3GK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CFZX3GK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
