window.products.push({"id":532293,"name":"COOSLEEP Lay Flat Sleeping Dual OKIN Motor Lift Chair Recliners for Elderly with Heat and Massage Up to 350 LBS,Genuine Leather,USB Ports (Brown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aJJ+vlf-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Top Layer Cowhide】The Power Lift Recliner Chair is made of top cowhide leather, with thick cushions cushioned with high-density sponge for support but comfort, soft leather, beautiful finishes and stitching, wearable and waterproof, and a solid metal frame for durability and safety. 【DUAL OKIN ALL COPPER MOTOR】Once formed housing, all copper rotor, silent bearing, Lower failure rate than ordinary electric recliners. The upgraded design of 2 motors can independently control the backrest and footrest. Push the entire chair up to help seniors to stand up easily. it’s ideal for people who have leg/back problems or Pregnancy, Recovering from Surgery.If the motor fails, it is easy to disassemble and two people can finish replacing the new motor at home (brand new motor is provided free of charge for one year) 【Heating and Massage】The lift chair has 8 vibration nodes in the back, waist, thighs and legs; 3 massage modes (pulse, pressure, wave) with 3 intensities from low to high. There is a heating system for the lumbar area, which can provide careful care for the elderly's back; temperature-controlled heating with 113℉~140℉, when it reaches 140℉, it will automatically cut off the power and continue to cool down to 113℉ before heating. 【Unlimited positions】The backrest can be operated from 100° to 180°, and the footrest can be operated from 90° to 180°. The position lock of the lift chair is unlimited. You can recline to any degree almost level with the ground or above (with or without raised footrest), and can be used as a bed for lounging completely flat. The extended footrest and recline feature allows you to fully stretch and relax, such as reading, sleeping, watching TV, etc. 【Easy to assemble】After obtaining a recliner, you will receive the following components: seat *1, backrest *1, left armrest *1, right armrest *1, remote control *1, power supply *1, anti-fall bracket *2. Two boxes, two boxes may not arrive on the same day, it usually takes 3-5 working days. It usually takes about five minutes to assemble. 【Warranty Policy】Quality problems not caused by human factors: 30 days free return, 180 days free exchange.3-year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aJJ+vlf-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COOSLEEP HOME","source_asin":"B0BRTZ1HYZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-532293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRTZ1HYZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRTZ1HYZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
