window.products.push({"id":532385,"name":"Schott Zwiesel Tritan Crystal Glass Diva Living Stemware Collection Champagne Flute with Effervescence Points, 7.4-Ounce, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hlnBiLZrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Schott Zwiesel, the famed German producer of \"the best crystal glassware\" has been a leader in innovation, style and technology for more than 100 years.  The company has many firsts to its credit, including the first fully automated product of glass blown glass stemware.  In the 1990's, as the glass industry struggled with the environmental issues of lead and other heavy metals in crystal, the company was the first glassmaker to produce lead-free crystal glass of superb quality and brilliance. Schott Zwiesel created Tritan crystal in 2001 by adding titanium oxide and zirconium oxide to develop \"the world's best crystal glass\".  Tritan crystal is 100% dishwasher safe-it will not etch, cloud or discolor for the life of the glass.  Tritan resists the damages of daily use-breakage, chipping and scratching.  Tritan is thermal shock resistant.  Tritan is one of the most clear and brilliant crystal, capable of conducting, refracting and transferring light more than any other crystal.  Tritan tempers the rim, the bowl and stem joint and the foot edge for added strength against chipping and breakage.  All crystal items manufactured by Schott Zwiesel are cut with our patented laser technology for a smooth thin, elegant edge.  All stemware products are seamless after manufacturing; no unsightly seams remain between the bowl and stem, on the stem, or under the foot of the glass.  Each detail of size, weight and balance is carefully studied by experts in the culinary field and our manufacturing engineers. The diva living collection features the same beautiful style as the diva collection but offers a shorter stem for easy storage and cleaning in the dishwasher. The diva living collection is a full line with the proper stem for your favorite drink. This set of 6 Tritan crystal champagne flutes contain 6 laser points etched in each glass for continuous bubbles. Best utilized with: champagne, Asti, cava, Prosecco.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hlnBiLZrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Schott Zwiesel","source_asin":"B00N5NXIPI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-532385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N5NXIPI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N5NXIPI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":532386,"name":"Literary Calligraphy Article 3: Justice Art Print By Susan Loy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.03,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lGZC2QL5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Using steel pens and watercolor brushes, Susan Loy hand-lettered Article III of the U.S. Constitution over a drawing of the scales of justice. Fragments from Hammurabi's code, lettered in cuneiform, provide the background for the words to Article III. The names of historic law givers, lawyers, and Supreme Court justices fill the arcs on four sides: (upper arc) Hammurabi, Solon, Confucius, Grotius, William Blackston, John Marshall, (lower arc) John Rutledge, Thurgood Marshall, Sandra Day O'Connor, John Jay, (left arc), James Wilson, Louis Dembitz Brandeis, Ruth Bader Ginsburg, Wm. Strong, (right arc), John Blair, Oliver Wendell Holmes, Felix Frankfurter, Samuel Chase. Carrying over the colors of black, brown, red, white, and blue and the themes established in \"The Preamble,\" she outlined the words, \"Justice\" and \"We the People.\" She used elements from the Supreme Court Building in the design, lettering the words incised on the architrave above the west and east porticos, \"Equal Justice Under Law\" and \"Justice the Guardian of Liberty.\" Print produced from Susan Loy’s original watercolor. Package includes bio and information sheet. Print is either shipped in secure mailing tube or enclosed in an extra-rigid fiberboard photo document mailer. Print Image Size: 9.5\" x 9.5\" Print Paper Size: 11-1/2\" x 11\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lGZC2QL5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Literary Calligraphy","source_asin":"B00JAOB524","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-532386","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JAOB524","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JAOB524","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":532387,"name":"Supla 50 Sets Graduation Party Invitation Cards Graduation Announcement Cards Gold Foil Design Grad Party Invitations with Envelopes Stickers Pens for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XZ8YEAqwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Quantity: Package includes 50 Pcs Graduation Party Invitation Cards, 50 Pcs White V-flap Envelopes for easy sealing, 60 pcs Round Party Favor Label Stickers in 12 patterns, and 3 pcs Gold Glitter Painting Pens. Color & Design: The grad party invitations feature gold foil text surrounded by a shimmering gold frame and black stripes border on a white background. The upper half of these cards read the words of “Join us for a graduation PARTY HONORING” with a black graduation cap and swirls at the top. The lower half are designed for filling in party information (DATE, TIME, WHERE, RSVP, PHONE) with a scene of graduates throwing away graduation cap at the bottom. The reverse side is in white and black striped pattern. Material: Cards are made of 120 lb weight,17.5 pt thickness and clearly printed with simple but elegant designs. All the gold designs are foil stamped and the black patterns are not. The front of the cards is matte for easy writing. Envelopes are made from 80lb quality paper, thick enough and will not easy to tear. Round labels are made of sticker paper, easy to stick and removed without residue. Application Graduation parties are a great way to celebrate the graduate's accomplishments on their life and these invitations are perfect for letting everyone know when and where to show up for the party! Write on each invitation, and send it to invite and gather your friends and family together to celebrate your graduate's big day. The little round stickers are perfect for adding that finishing decor. In this season, these sparkling invitations are sure to get your guests excited about your party if you want it to stand out from a plethora of parties. The gold foil and striped design makes these invitation cards fitting for a high school graduation party, college graduation party, graduate school graduation party, and any other graduation celebration in between.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XZ8YEAqwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Windiy","source_asin":"B07Q1WFC3G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-532387","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q1WFC3G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q1WFC3G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
