window.products.push({"id":532500,"name":"Paula Deen 8.5QT (1700 Watt) Large Air Fryer, Rapid Air Circulation System, Square Single Basket System, Ceramic Non-Stick Coating, Easy-to-Use Dial, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GU5vnKvCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"8.5QT LARGE AIR FRYER - Paula Deen's air fryer features a square single basket design that allows you to cook large enough portions to feed everyone around your dinner table (4-6 people). But, with its shallow depth, this air fryer won’t take up valuable counter space in your kitchen. Square Basket dimensions: L:10 in. x W:10 in. x H: 5 in. SIMPLE DIAL CONTROLS – The large dial controls the temperature and features large, easy-to-read temperature settings up to 430ºF. The smaller center dial controls the timer and allow up to 60 minutes of cook time. Paula has also included a handy cooking guide on the top that lists the common time and temperature settings for 10 popular air fryer needs. Including: French Fries, Wings, Pizza, Meat, Bake, Fish, Toast, Vegetable, Reheat and Keep Warm. STAINLESS-STEEL INTERIOR – The unique stainless steel cooking chamber reflects heat to provide an even temperature throughout the cooking basket. This ensures that your food is cooked perfectly every time. EASY TO CLEAN - Features FDA-compliant ceramic non-stick coating to make cleaning a breeze. After cooking, allow the basket to cool down and then wipe clean with a kitchen cloth or place in the top rack of the dishwasher. SUPPORTS A HEALTHIER LIFESTYLE - Do you love crispy, crunchy, savory fried foods that are juicy and tender on the inside, but not all the fat and added calories? Then you need an air fryer. When cooking with an air fryer, you benefit from less fat and up to 85% less calories because little to no oil is used. Cook healthier food options for you and your family, such as Chicken, Steak, Pork, Fish, Root Vegetables, French Fries, Pizza, Cake.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GU5vnKvCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paula Deen","source_asin":"B08PP1HMSR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-532500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PP1HMSR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PP1HMSR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
