window.products.push({"id":532606,"name":"LEMBERI 8000 BTU Portable Air Conditioners,Quiet Room Portable AC Unit up to 350 Sq Ft,3 in 1 Compact Cooling Unit with Dehumidifier and Fan Functions","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":269.01,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F6sWFYWDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄【8,000/10,000 BTU Powerful Cooling】 Lemberi 8,000/10,000 BTU portable ac is suitable for rooms up to 350 Sq.Ft, can cool a room to the temperature between 62°F-86°F. Providing you with stable/fast/effective cooling. This portable ac is suitable for any corner and perfect for living room, study, bedroom, storeroom, garage and apartments.Keeping you cool and comfortable all summer. ❄【3-in-1 Operation】 Combined 3 energy efficient functions for all of your daily needs, with cool, fan & dehumidifying (40/50 pints per 24 hours) modes. Automatic defrost function and self-evaporating system makes your living space cool, clean and dry. Use cool mode for powerful cooling and dehumidifying on hot days. In fan mode, the fan circulates the air in the room. Dry mode is ideal for damp and rainy days. Besides, sleep mode with quiet low noise(≤54dB) ensures no disturbance in the evening. All settings are operated by user-friendly control panel or remote control, without leaving your bed, workspace, or couch. ❄【24H Timer & Sleep Mode】 The Portable Air Conditioner is built-in timer from 1 to 24hours, all settings are operated by user-friendly control panel or remote control, without leaving your bed, workspace, or couch. In sleep mode with quiet low noise(≤54dB) ,the fans can be turned off when you fall asleep at the time you set. Use the timer function, can also turn on the air conditioner in advance. ❄【Washable Air Filter】 The portable ac has a removable and washable double-layer filter to protect you and your family from dust, pet dander and hair. How to clean the air filter,just wash it under running water twice a month.Every two week to clean the air filter can ensure its conditioning efficiency and help prevent air quality problems. ❄【Easy to Install & Move】 All accessories are included in the package, with window kit, window kit adapter, exhaust hose, hose connector and clear instruction. It is easy and quick to install under the guidance of instruction.No extra tools needed. Combined with 4 universal wheels and 2 side design handle, the portable ac can be moved to any room with windows. ❄【After-sales Warranty】 All of Lemberi Portable air Conditioner Units offer 60 days free exchange and refund service and ONE-YEAR warranty. Please feel free to contact us,if you have any problems. NOTE:Cooling capital there are two international standards, Namely SACC and AHRAE. Our air conditioner SACC is 5000BTU, and AHRAE is 8000BTU. The actual power is the same.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F6sWFYWDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEMBERI","source_asin":"B0BZP17BSR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-532606","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZP17BSR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZP17BSR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
