window.products.push({"id":532673,"name":"SOL Organics Fair Trade Organic Cotton Sheets Luxury Queen Sateen Ivory 300 Thread Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HU9faYlFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Luxurious Super Soft Organic Sheet sets made out of Long Staple Organic Cotton Single Ply Thread. Available in inviting solid colors of white ivory and blue. The fine Sateen weave has a super silky hand and lustrous shine . Durable Ethical Soft sheets perfect for every bedroom. Simply the best sheets available in Cal King,King, Queen,Full,Twin XL, and Twin sizes Each set includes a flat sheet a fitted sheet and two pillow cases. The fitted sheet is fully elasticized to fit your mattress and has a 16“deep pocket. For easy care they are machine washable and can be tumble dried. Additional pillow cases are sold on request.  100% Fair Trade Certified Organic Cotton  ORGANIC COTTON FOR THE PLANET - FAIR TRADE FOR THE FARMER - AFFORDABLE LUXURY FOR YOU  Uncompromising luxury is about quality, comfort, honesty, transparency & affordability.  SOL Organics Sheet Sets:  Twin 1 Flat Sheet 66\" x 97\", 1 Fitted Sheet 38.5\" x 76\" x 15\", 2 Pillow Cases 20.5\" x 31\"   Twin XL 1 Flat Sheet 66\" x 98\", 1 Fitted Sheet 38.5\" x 76\" x 15\", 2 Pillow Cases 20.5\" x 30.5\"  Full 1 Flat Sheet 87\" x 96\", 1 Fitted Sheet 54\" x 75\" x 16\", 2 Pillow Cases 21\" x 32.5\"  Queen 1 Flat Sheet 92\" x 102\", 1 Fitted Sheet 60\" x 80\" x 16\", 2 Pillow Cases 21\" x 32.5\"  King 1 Flat Sheet 109\" x 102\", 1 Fitted Sheet 78\" x 80\" x 16\", 2 Pillow Cases 21\" x 40\"  Cal King 1 Flat Sheet 101\" x 107\", 1 Fitted Sheet 72\" x 84\" x 15\", 2 Pillow cases 21\" x 41\"  Cleaning Instructions  Washing: Wash sheets in cold water with half the recommended amount of detergent. Do not use bleach or whiteners as they can weaken and damage fibers over time and also cause yellowing.  Drying: If machine drying, we suggest low tumble dry. Provide the linens room to dry properly without excess time, heat and rotations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HU9faYlFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOL Organics","source_asin":"B019G2HLBS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-532673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019G2HLBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019G2HLBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
