window.products.push({"id":532934,"name":"Lunch Bag for Women, Reusable Insulated Lunch Box Large Wide-Open Water Resistant Adult Cooler Tote Bag for Work, Travel, Picnic - Brown (Printed, D)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aR15qRekL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>💕</p>【Fashionable Lunch Bag】The uniquely designed lunch bag women, exquisite appearance and wrinkle-resistant shape make you say goodbye to the simple bag on the way to work and replace it with this practical and fashionable insulated lunch bag suitable for your elegant style. It can make your charm get the greatest praise! The fashionable style design makes the lunch bag is ideal to be used for men and women. <p>🍕</p>【Large Capacity Design】Thanks to the humanized wide-open design, you can easily put any food you want in the oversized pocket, and prevent the liquid from leaking from the container to save cleaning time. The front pocket is used to holding tableware, and the mesh pockets on both sides are used to hold drinks, water bottles or umbrellas. Dimensions: 10.5 \"L x 6.8\" W x 11.8 \"H. <p>😍</p>【Upgrade Aluminum Film】 Unlike others, our lunch bag women is made of aluminum film instead of EVA lining. The high-density three-layer fabric is lined with high-quality aluminum film material that can withstand high temperature and is not easy to wrinkle. High-quality aluminum film can keep food cool, warm and fresh for a long time. If you are looking for a lunch box that can withstand high temperature, it will impress you! <p>👍</p>【Outstanding Details】Strong metal zipper & leather zipper end, rivet reinforcement & strong handle are all showing the most exquisite details we can bring you. It is worth mentioning that the metal zipper is comfortable and smooth, and all pockets use seamless waterproof zipper. After 10000 tests, the zipper will not deform or break. The handle is reinforced with multiple stitches for durability. <p>🎁</p>【Multi-Purpose Lunch Bag】The easy-to-clean lunch bag is a practical gift for family and friends, because this fashionable lunch box can not only be used for office, but also for outdoor picnic or family party. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us and we will try our best to solve them for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aR15qRekL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAGNN","source_asin":"B0BQBWKNVT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-532934","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQBWKNVT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQBWKNVT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
