window.products.push({"id":532958,"name":"Trademark Fine Art Flowers in a Striped Vase by Debra Lake, 18x24","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":63.74,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ml5Tna0PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features two white flowers in a vase on a linen background. Debra is a self-taught artist who began painting in college. She enjoys drawing and painting subjects that enchant her, with her greatest inspiration coming from a childhood spent playing in the countryside of New England. Her images are often taken directly from her country living and depict delicate flowers in subtle colors Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ml5Tna0PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B07QB9HGN2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-532958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QB9HGN2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QB9HGN2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":532959,"name":"Antique Revival Gota Wooden Bucket, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nlaYPLj5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This vintage Gota wooden bucket is a great accent piece for your entryway, kitchen, living room or patio. The bucket is wide enough that you can easily use it to hold various items or let it make a statement on its own. The iron ear handles and band around the middle, along with the distressed white finish, add to the authentic rustic vibe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nlaYPLj5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Porthos Home","source_asin":"B00BQKERAW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-532959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BQKERAW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BQKERAW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":532960,"name":"SportMag Magnetic Gym Towels for Men & Women - Keep Your Sports Towel Off The Dirty Floor! Includes 2 Quick Dry Microfiber Workout Towels with Grommet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GMXwwjShL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quick-dry High Quality Medium-weight Microfiber, 1 Blue , 1 Gray (Grey) KEEP YOUR GYM TOWEL OFF THE DIRTY FLOOR - HANG IT UP! Hang your SportMag gym towel directly on steel workout equipment (just about every machine in a gym) with a high powered (and, very importantly, scratch-proof) magnet and carabiner keeping it from touching the dirty floor, hand rails and seats. SPORTMAG SAVES YOU MONEY! Don't rent a locker, just latch your keys onto the carabiner. Hang your shaker bottle too. The magnet lives up to our company standard of SCARY STRONG. Easily portable for travel, perfect for small hotel gyms! Our innovative protective magnet cap prevents surface damage to equipment by placing a soft barrier between the magnet and the mounting surface, avoiding metal-on-metal contact that can scratch. NOT JUST FOR THE GYM! SportMag isn't only for muscle heads. Stick it to your golf bag or cart. Perfect hand and face towel for outdoor sports, cycling, yoga, pilates, zumba, and on-equipment such as an exercise bike, elliptical machine, treadmill, and stair stepper. Outside the gym, SportMag easily adapts to any job. It's super-handy to have high quality microfiber towels ready in the kitchen & garage. UNIQUE AND USEFUL ADDITION TO YOUR CLEANING SUPPLIES. We believe that every mother, father, nanny, manny, and housekeeper in the world should own a SportMag. In fact, for this use, we're going to call it a NannyMag! Until you have one, you'll won't understand how unbelievably useful it is to have high quality microfiber towels within easy reach any time. And remember, the protective magnet cap makes it safe to mount anywhere without scratching your fine and delicate surfaces. THE GIFT THAT WORKS 365 DAYS A YEAR - WITH LIFETIME PROTECTION. The Magnet Will Not Corrode or Demagnetize. Ever. Or we’ll replace it. Enjoy peace of mind knowing that a Monster has your back.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GMXwwjShL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Monster Magnetics","source_asin":"B06XGJYCKD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-532960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XGJYCKD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XGJYCKD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":532961,"name":"Ice Cube Trays Silicone Set of 2,Ice Cube trays with lid Flexible 74-Ice Trays for drinks,free BPA 2 Pack … (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SN3BALt6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size: 205*120*25mm Material: silicone Temperature range: -40℃~+230℃ Cubes: 37 Package list: 2 x ice cubes tray Features: - Food grade material: The ice cubes tray is made of silicone material. food grade, BPA free, nontoxic, odourless, no harmful substances. - Easy to release: High quality silicone, making it easy to release ice cubes. It is stackable, compact, fits any home refrigerator, oven and microwave oven. - Easy to clean: Smooth silicone surface for easy cleaning, rinse with water and dishwasher safe. - Easy to use: You just fill the trays with water and then slip the trays into the freezer. You also can fill it with fruits, ice cream, soda and wine to customize your favorite flavor. - Wide application: For cocktail, iced coffee, iced tea, fruit juice, soda pop and more. Great for house parties, home bars, wedding and more. - Removable lid: Comes with a removable lid, preventing spills and keeping ice cubes from absorbing freezer odors. Warm tips: - Recommended to wash and dry before first use. Notes: Please allowed 1-3mm differences due to manual measurement, thank you for your understanding!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SN3BALt6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bell Dream","source_asin":"B08R6ZMKP5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-532961","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R6ZMKP5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R6ZMKP5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":532962,"name":"Shun DM0777 Classic Kiritsuke Knife, Stainless Steel, 6\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LL+9J1X-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For those chefs that prefer a smaller knife, the Shun Classic 6-Inch Kiritsuke Knife is a great solution. It features a slightly shorter blade for easy maneuverability and versatility. This smaller version of the Classic 8-Inch Kiritsuke Knife is capable of completing several cutting tasks around the kitchen. This 6-inch knife blade slices, dices and minces. Its slightly curved edge is ideal for rocking cuts. Kiritsuke is the only multipurpose traditional Japanese knife and in Japan only the executive chef in the kitchen is allowed to use one. Shun Classic knife blades are made with solid core of Shun's proprietary VG-MAX steel and feature a 16 degree cutting angle on each side. The ebony D-Shape Packwood handles have that sleek, sophisticated look that makes these knives feel more like art, than instrument and are specifically designed for premium applications. The specially shaped handles rest perfectly in the curve of the fingers, for a more secure grip while handles remain moisture resistant. The bolster is ground out more on the right side for proper finger placement, as well as balancing the knives perfectly. Precision blades and handle engineering mean long-lasting use and comfort-no matter how large or small you kitchen prep may be. Crafted in Seki City Japan, our Shun Classics are forged in the tradition of samurai sword making. These heirloom quality knives will be a prized treasure you'll want to pass down to family for generations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LL+9J1X-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shun","source_asin":"B01CET3TLG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-532962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CET3TLG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CET3TLG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
